              "y": 99,
              "name": "Contact Help Body",
              "fill": "#66708A",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 480,
              "content": "If you can, include a photo, the part's job, and a rough dimension. That is usually enough to decide whether a standard configuration will work.",
